3|0@AskReddit^1440435888#cue2aed:PotatoManPerson$:What I think bilko365 means, is that we never really have any dangerous weather. For example, I've never seen a hurricane in my life. We do have rainy, damp, and cold weather a lot. For example, this summer we have had maybe three weeks worth of nice, sunny days tops. It's been cloudy most of the time.
