2|0@AskReddit^1440468943#cuemzqv:Jeqk$:There's no extremes of weather really. So it's not so much that it's crappy as that it's very changeable. You'll seldom get a spell of more than a few days of any one type, and often you'll get all four seasons in a day. It's very easy, for instance, to go out in the morning dressed for midsummer and then find yourself spending an afternoon shivering in a steady drizzle. Or dress for cold weather and find yourself shedding layers of clothing as the day goes on and then having to lug them around everywhere with you in a baking heat. 
